    "text": "Text of the notice under the heading Some files cannot be opened, above the file list of a private room; the plural form, where count is the number of such files in the open folder. Two full sentences stating a fact with no remedy; here means in this folder, and key means the user's personal encryption key. In a language with several plural forms, put the number after a colon so one wording fits every count.",
